  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「モモッチ直進～！　回転っ、旋回！　ジャ～ンプ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「最後に、こまっち先輩のおっぱいに顔面むぎゅむぎゅ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「これがあたしの必殺技、モモッチ☆ダイブの極意っす！　良い子は真似しちゃ駄目っすよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「こまっち先輩には隙がないので、こんぐらい動き回らないと懐に潜らせてくれないっす！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「あたしも苦労してるんすよ～、おやっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「転校生の先輩っ、こっちこっち！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「危うくはぐれるところだったっす、あたしが走り回るせいっすかね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「でも先輩も、『のんびり』しすぎっすよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「もうちょい急いでほしいっす、手ぇ引っぱっちゃお……ぎゅ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「さっさと買い出しを終わらせて、本部に戻らないと～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「梅園先輩たちにばっかり、仕事を押しつけちゃったら申し訳ないっす！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「『夏祭り』の準備とかは、あたしが任された仕事っすからね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「むしろ、何で先輩たちが手伝ってくれてるのかわからないっすけど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「ていうか、転校生の先輩はいつも走り回って人助けしてるっすよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「こまっち先輩もあちこちで『助っ人』してるっすけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「それはお菓子とかの報酬が目当て……だと思うっす。たぶん。本人は、『暇つぶし』って言ってるっすけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「でも転校生の先輩は、あんまり見返りを求めてない感じっすよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「ふぅん。生徒会長さんに憧れて、真似っこしてるんすか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「そっすか～。そういえば生徒会長さんも、いつも走り回って人助けしてるっすね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「すごいひとっすよね、今回『夏祭り』の準備とかしてあらためて思ったっすけど……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「毎度毎度、いろんな学校行事を主催して盛りあげてるっすもんね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「あのひとみたいに、なりたいんすか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「べつに笑わないっすよ、先輩はいつも無口だから自分のこと喋ってくれるの嬉しいっす♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「憧れかぁ……あたしにとっての、こまっち先輩っすね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「必死になって追いかけて、いつか背中に手を届かせて、できたら横に並びたい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「そう思える、尊敬できるひとがいるのって奇跡みたいに幸運なことっすよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「ともあれまぁ、先輩が喜んで手伝ってくれてるんなら一安心っすけど……。」"
